  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Calling the free spirits!! Chart your course with the adidas Originals Handball Spezial. Brimming with sophistication and style, these low-profile sneakers channel an always-on retro vibe that echoes undeniable coolness. But wait, these shoes get better. Boasting a premium suede upper that's accented by 3-Stripes and other signature details, these archival silhouettes are a nostalgia trip you surely wouldn’t want to miss. Released in 1979 for pro indoor courts and gradually transformed into street-style icons, the adidas Originals Handball Spezial lets you march to the beat of your own drums.</p> <p><strong>adidas Originals Handball Spezial</strong><strong> features: </strong></p> <ul> <li>Regular fit offers a relaxed feel.</li> <li>Lace closure ensures a snug fit.</li> <li>Synthetic lining adds breathability.</li> <li>Rubber outsole delivers durability and traction.</li> </ul> <hr /> <p>Retro court style still hits different when it feels this easy to wear. The adidas Originals Handball Spezial brings its 1979 indoor-sport roots into everyday rotation with a low-profile silhouette, premium suede details, and a classic gum sole that keeps the look timeless. Easy to dress up or down, this women’s pair blends archival adidas DNA with the kind of comfort that makes it an everyday favorite.</p> <ul> <li>Premium suede upper with signature 3-Stripes and Spezial branding</li> <li>Lace closure helps secure the fit</li> <li>Synthetic lining adds a smooth, breathable feel</li> <li>Rubber outsole provides durable traction</li> </ul> <p><strong>Size & Fit Guidance</strong></p> <p>For the best fit, we recommend ordering a half size down, as many reviewers found the Handball Spezial runs a little roomy; some preferred a full size down, while others liked their usual adidas size for a more relaxed feel. Reviews also frequently mention comfortable arch support and cushioning for long days on your feet.</p> <p><strong>Best For</strong></p> <p>Best for everyday wear, travel, and casual outfits that shift easily from laid-back to polished.</p> <p><strong>Styling & Versatility</strong></p> <p>This is the kind of sneaker reviewers reach for on repeat because it works with almost everything. The slim profile, retro lines, and gum sole give the adidas Originals Handball Spezial an easy mix of sport heritage and street-ready style that pairs well with jeans, trousers, dresses, and more.</p> <p><strong>Break-In & Durability</strong></p> <p>Most reviewers describe the comfort as immediate, with a cushioned, supportive feel that holds up well for walking, standing, and daily wear. Some also note the upper feels even better after a few wears as it starts to mold more naturally to the foot.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>adidas Originals Handball Spezial - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Off White/Gum/Cream White</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>JP6687</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">adidas Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Women's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official adidas shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 4.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 42.0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 42.6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 5.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 43.3</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 44.0</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8